From d95db797ff98353b2e780067bae6473f9f80c681 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Cochran <40193276+kevincloud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:09:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Offer paid upgrades to Plus and Elite members at the gate

The gate agent offers an upgrade to eligible passengers when they reach the
door, processes the reseating when they accept, and the ops board exposes
offer and acceptance counts at /api/upgrades. The offer takes 2.5 to 4
simulated minutes per passenger before they head to their seat. The deck
rings passengers who are mid-offer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
